[gd_scene load_steps=15 format=3]

; Directly editor-owned R1 landmark form. The daytime structure follows the
; red/yellow 1990s Santa Monica wheel: white open lattice, twenty faceted
; gondolas with broad dark roofs, and yellow/red hub faces. Christina's supplied
; night reference controls the grouped colored spoke tubes and yellow rim tube.
; ParkPlan's fixed hub, radius, WHEEL_TOP and operating envelope remain intact.

